      "en": "and showing loving kindness to thousands of those who love me and keep my commandments.",
      "ko": "나를 사랑하고 내 계명을 지키는 자에게는 천대까지 은혜를 베푸느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "ff9dbbc32767d8bab766ef6c8fe8f7a5cefcc351709ad5487d71aa1de56bb21b",
      "translation_text_hash": "9f59ebdd38d30e6359f3eb6c9a291f30a600df97fffb90c2ceb2fd742e93a964",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
