      "en": "Oh that there were such a heart in them that they would fear me and keep all my commandments always, that it might be well with them and with their children forever!",
      "ko": "다만 그들이 항상 이같은 마음을 품어 나를 경외하며 나의 모든 명령을 지켜서 그들과 그 자손이 영원히 복 받기를 원하노라",
      "source_text_hash": "c80bb49926ce90ac9b7271b67a5fd1b945cb9861571423c7bdff7acd8d4a2e58",
      "translation_text_hash": "020ef8dfdc92919d48b29263af4d685aaf7bb722a9c68608dada59236ee80dc0",
