      "en": "You shall walk in all the way which the LORD your God has commanded you, that you may live and that it may be well with you, and that you may prolong your days in the land which you shall possess.",
      "ko": "너희 하나님 여호와께서 너희에게 명하신 모든 도를 행하라 그리하면 너희가 삶을 얻고 복을 얻어서 너희의 얻은 땅에서 너희의 날이 장구하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "af8f77428cc7427f6bda3f1d15b1ffe710890e20300d5c7afec1ab272c3d13f2",
      "translation_text_hash": "528131ee39c640fbdf2cea70019405b52101c5b61911941c434187dfbe67c0c0",
